      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vernon_Center%2C_Minnesota"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Nestled on the north side of the scenic Blue Earth River, Vernon Center sits in Blue County, Minnesota.",
