      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vernon_Center%2C_Minnesota"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The town was officially platted in 1857, marking the beginning of its development.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        18
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vernon_Center%2C_Minnesota"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Surrounded by southern Minnesota’s richest farmland, Vernon Center’s economy thrives on agriculture and local businesses.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        25
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://vernoncentermn.com/"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Vernon Center serves as a convenient stop along the historic Daniel Boone Motor Trail.",
